#: ../../source/index.rst:5 838a066547a34a189d6f28c0338b4c1f
msgid "MAVProxy"
msgstr "MAVProxy"

#: ../../source/index.rst:7 fa4a61784117445e96d0c9786f55c725
msgid "**A UAV ground station software package for MAVLink based systems**"
msgstr "**基于MAVLink系统的无人机地面站软件包**"

#: ../../source/index.rst:9 d29be3160c50413a8188fa5dff62da39
msgid ""
"MAVProxy is a fully-functioning GCS for UAV's, designed as a minimalist, "
"portable and extendable GCS for any autonomous system supporting the MAVLink"
" protocol (such as one using ArduPilot). MAVProxy is a powerful command-line"
" based “developer” ground station software.  It can be extended via add-on "
"modules, or complemented with another ground station, such as Mission "
"Planner, APM Planner 2, QGroundControl etc, to provide a graphical user "
"interface."
msgstr ""
"MAVProxy是一款功能完整的无人机GCS，设计为支持MAVLink协议的任何自主系统（如使用ArduPilot的系统）的轻量级、可移植且可扩展的地面站软件。MAVProxy是一款功能强大的命令行「开发者」地面站软件，可通过附加模块进行扩展，或与Mission"
" Planner、APM Planner 2、QGroundControl等其他地面站配合使用，以提供图形用户界面。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:14 b639e9d129b941cfb707691454a59e33
msgid ""
"It has a number of key features, including the :ref:`ability to forward the "
"messages<mavproxy-forwarding>` from your UAV over the network via UDP to "
"multiple other ground station software on other devices."
msgstr ""
"其主要功能之一是 :ref:`将消息转发 <mavproxy-forwarding>`，通过UDP网络将无人机消息转发至其他设备上的多个地面站软件。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:16 380420d3ad96433884511a7c14868ab1
msgid ""
"MAVProxy is commonly used by developers (especially with SITL) for testing "
"new builds."
msgstr "MAVProxy常被开发者（尤其是配合SITL）用于测试新版本。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:18 2874a3c192ae4d49bf8a89b1ae5e4a5b
msgid ""
"MAVProxy was first developed by `CanberraUAV "
"<http://www.canberrauav.org.au>`_, to enable the use of companion computing "
"and multiple datalinks with ArduPilot. It has grown to be one of the most "
"versatile tools in the ArduPilot ecosystem, and many of the features users "
"now see in other GCS tools can trace their origins to MAVProxy."
msgstr ""
"MAVProxy最初由 `CanberraUAV <http://www.canberrauav.org.au>`_ "
"开发，旨在支持ArduPilot与伴飞计算机及多数传链路的配合使用。它已成为ArduPilot生态系统中最通用的工具之一，许多其他地面站工具中用户熟悉的功能都可追溯至MAVProxy的早期实现。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:25 bdba04d4259643a88a2622924d27e7d2
msgid "Features"
msgstr "功能特性"

#: ../../source/index.rst:27 53f421db2ed245b4a7fc2149e3835f73
msgid ""
"It is a command-line, console based app. There are plugins included in "
"MAVProxy to provide a basic GUI."
msgstr "这是一款基于命令行控制台的应用程序。MAVProxy内置插件可提供基本图形界面。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:29 0940a3606e2743a18d0a4ce69abdf1ac
msgid "Can be networked and run over any number of computers."
msgstr "支持网络化运行，可跨多台计算机使用。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:30 805dc0472dd24d5b92f993d288f9bc4d
msgid ""
"It's portable; it should run on any POSIX OS with python, pyserial, and "
"``select()`` function calls, which means Linux, OS X, Windows, and others."
msgstr ""
"具有良好的可移植性；可在任何支持Python、pyserial及 ``select()`` 函数调用的POSIX操作系统上运行，包括Linux、OS "
"X、Windows等。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:33 0d12c8e2cd7e432b9a209bb6c0ec81bf
msgid "The light-weight design means it can run on small netbooks with ease."
msgstr "轻量级设计使其可轻松运行于小型上网本。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:34 1af71f01331744459e3d13772309016e
msgid ""
"It supports loadable modules, and has modules to support console/s, moving "
"maps, joysticks, antenna trackers, etc"
msgstr "支持可加载模块，内置模块支持控制台、动态地图、摇杆、天线跟踪器等功能。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:36 47939c9712c64705b86e2e3a31c4e44f
msgid "Tab-completion of commands."
msgstr "命令Tab键自动补全。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:40 e7717c5f38f548fcaaefa3590dde8245
msgid "Screenshots"
msgstr "截图"

#: ../../source/index.rst:44 569257020cfa4b0f8eb66df10511d43f
msgid "MAVProxy running under Ubuntu"
msgstr "MAVProxy在Ubuntu下运行"

#: ../../source/index.rst:48 7364095b7a0045ccbcdd801a41cd2712
msgid "MAVProxy running under Windows 10"
msgstr "MAVProxy在Windows 10下运行"

#: ../../source/index.rst:51 b83e3026e26843d2a6b0018f7c2ff979
msgid "Quick Reference Card"
msgstr "快速参考卡"

#: ../../source/index.rst:53 a2c1a826e5c94990a25e1fa92b864bd5
msgid ""
"A table of commonly used MAVProxy commands is available :ref:`here "
"<mavproxy-cheetsheet>`."
msgstr "常用MAVProxy命令速查表可 :ref:`在此 <mavproxy-cheetsheet>` 查阅。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:56 68d33e1ae952424baa34356cec905083
msgid "License"
msgstr "许可证"

